              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngo Ndazi amarushwa yawe n’ubgoro bgawe (yamar’ ur’ umutunzi), n’ibitutsi vy’abiyita Abayuda, atari bo, arikw ar’ isinagogi ya Satani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
