        },
        {
          "text": "Ntutinye ivy’ ugira ubabazwe. Eh’ uwo Murwanizi agira ashire bamwe muri mwebge mw ibohero kugira ngo mugeragezwe, kandi muzogira amarushwa imisi cumi. Wame uyoboka gushitsa ku gupfa, nanje nzoguha igitsibo c’ubugingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
