        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Tuwatira, ut’ Umwana w’Imana, afise inyonga zisa n’imbeya z’umuriro, ibirenge vyiwe bisa n’umuringa w’umwakaka, aravuga ibi, ",
