              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngo Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe, n’urukundo rwawe, n’ukwizera kwawe, n’ingen’ ushitsa ibango ryawe, n’ukwihangana kwawe, kandi kw ibikorwa vyawe vyo hanyuma biruta ivya mbere kuba vyinshi. ",
