              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mfise ico nkugayako, yuk’ ukundira urya mugore Yezebeli, yiyita ūvugishwa n’Imana, akigisha akazimiza abagurano banje, kugira ngo bashakane barye ivyaterekerejwe ibigirwamana. ",
          "type": "text",
