              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mweho abasigaye mu b’i Tuwatira, abadafise iyo nyigisho mwese, batāmenye ivyo ba bandi bita ivy’i bgina",
          "type": "text",
