              "text": "2:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ivy’ i bgina bisobanurwa ngw ibihishijwe: rāba 1 Kor 2:10.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " vya Satani, ndababgira, nti Nta wundi mutwaro mbikoreza atar’ uyu, ",
